# Paths AI agents should not search or load as context: build output, dependencies,
# lockfiles, logs, and historical lab write-ups. Ripgrep honors this file, and so do
# the agent tools built on it (Claude Code's Grep/Glob). .claude/settings.json also
# blocks direct reads of the generated paths.

# Dependencies and lockfiles (read package.json instead)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Build output, coverage, and source/bundle maps
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.map
*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs and secrets
*.log
.env

# Historical lab logs: past incidents, not current rules (see CLAUDE.md)
docs/lab*-*.md
